وَلَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ لَجَعَلَهُمْ أُمَّةً وَٰحِدَةً وَلَـٰكِن يُدْخِلُ مَن يَشَآءُ فِى رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ وَٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ مَا لَهُم مِّن وَلِىٍّ وَلَا نَصِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God had so pleased, He could have made them a single community, but He admits to His mercy whoever He will; the evildoers will have no one to protect or help them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"Allah willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah willed","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَجَعَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"He could have made them","transliteration":"lajaʿalahum","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"a community","transliteration":"ummatan","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ","en_gloss":"one","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُدْخِلُ","en_gloss":"He admits","transliteration":"yud'khilu","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in (to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَحْمَتِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"His Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"And the wrongdoers","transliteration":"wal-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلِىٍّۢ","en_gloss":"protector","transliteration":"waliyyin","verse_key":"42:8"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَل